A||||12||Denny||Fiero Dutch Classic II . . . Thanks!||||10||
Z||000000||Denny||08-20-2001||08:56 AM||||I want to personally thank the following folks for contributing to the success of the show:<P>Don Haag (Haagster) for the suggestion (and participation) to have the dew wipe replacement tech session. It went very well, and I received lots of positive feedback.<P>Don also contributed a subwoofer and an 88 service manual as door prizes.<P>Dawn Kline (Twig) for helping with the dew-wipe tech session.<P>Larry Wheeler (Old Lar) for the photo coverage and enthusiasm.<P>Bob and Penny Schlag for all the help in preparing for and running the show.<P>Jason Haughey for his design work on and procurement of the trophies, and obtaining prizes, and also for printing placards and ballots.<P>Tom Derr for procurement of prizes.<P>Jen Gilbert (Fierochic88) and the whole Gilbert clan and their friends for the rally prep.<P>Josh (88CoupeV6) and Jaime (Jaygee79) for their help at the registration table.<P>Bill Behret for his help at registration and vote tabulation<P>Bruce (Brucepts) and family for hosting (putting up with    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) the bag-stuffing party on Friday evening.<P>Dave Berkey (Fleabitdog) for leading us to Bruce's.<P>We all owe thanks to Chris Zinn (you can write to him @ hdninc@dejazzd.com) for providing the space for the show.<P>Everyone who participated! Without you folks we wouldn't have a show!<P>And last, but certainly not least, my wife Lynn for putting up with me these last 2-1/2 months while preparing for this.<P>If I've missed anyone, my apologies, and  please holler!<P>Denny<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 08-20-2001).]||||reg||10
